The Governor component replicates the method for reading Claude Code account
usage via the internal OAuth endpoint (GET https://api.anthropic.com/api/oauth/usage,
with the `anthropic-beta: oauth-2025-04-20` header and the access token from
~/.claude/.credentials.json). The auth + fetch approach and the CLI token-refresh
strategy were derived from that project's `api.py` and `claude_cli.py`.
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The OAuth usage endpoint is internal and undocumented; it may change or be
blocked without notice. See docs/SECURITY.md.
